## Nova Corporation Library

The Nova Corporation Library, maintained by the Legislative Division of the Regulations Department, is a trello board containing links to all publicly available content regarding the Corporation, including lore, legislation, archives, procedures, etc. If you are looking to learn more about the Corporation, or find any public release, the library is your best place. To view it, click on the following link: https://trello.com/b/IGoWRDNM/nova-corporation-library 
